# Plugins forced off on this profile. omarchy is a management box — the work happens on the
# server — so the skill listings these ship cost ~6.7k tokens of startup context per session
# here for skills with a zero invocation count. Measured 2026-08-25: 45.2k -> 38.5k tokens.
# Plugin skills cannot be hidden individually (skillOverrides skips plugin skills), so the
# whole plugin is the only lever. The claude.ai Sentry and Linear MCP connectors are separate
# and stay available.
DISABLED_PLUGINS = (
{{- if eq (.profile | lower) "omarchy" }}
